        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahab said to Jehoshaphat, “I told you that he never prophesies anything good for me; it's always something bad!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Micaiah went on: “Now listen to what the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says! I saw the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " sitting on his throne in heaven, with all his angels standing beside him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " asked, ‘Who will deceive Ahab so that he will go and get killed at Ramoth?’ Some of the angels said one thing, and others said something else, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "until a spirit stepped forward, approached the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and said, ‘I will deceive him.’ ‘How?’ the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " asked. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The spirit replied, ‘I will go and make all Ahab's prophets tell lies.’ The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, ‘Go and deceive him. You will succeed.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Micaiah concluded: “This is what has happened. The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has made these prophets of yours lie to you. But he himself has decreed that you will meet with disaster!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the prophet Zedekiah went up to Micaiah, slapped his face, and asked, “Since when did the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s spirit leave me and speak to you?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“You will find out when you go into some back room to hide,” Micaiah replied.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then King Ahab ordered one of his officers, “Arrest Micaiah and take him to Amon, the governor of the city, and to Prince Joash. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tell them to throw him in prison and to put him on bread and water until I return safely.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“If you return safely,” Micaiah exclaimed, “then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has not spoken through me!” And he added, “Listen, everyone, to what I have said!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then King Ahab of Israel and King Jehoshaphat of Judah went to attack the city of Ramoth in Gilead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahab said to Jehoshaphat, “As we go into battle, I will disguise myself, but you wear your royal garments.” So the king of Israel went into battle in disguise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The king of Syria had ordered his chariot commanders to attack no one else except the king of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So when they saw King Jehoshaphat, they all thought that he was the king of Israel, and they turned to attack him. But Jehoshaphat gave a shout, and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " God rescued him and turned the attack away from him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The chariot commanders saw that he was not the king of Israel, so they stopped pursuing him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "By chance, however, a Syrian soldier shot an arrow which struck King Ahab between the joints of his armour. “I'm wounded!” he cried out to his chariot driver. “Turn round and pull out of the battle!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "While the battle raged on, King Ahab remained propped up in his chariot, facing the Syrians. At sunset he died.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
